From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prithwiraj Samanta <app@datainsights.ae>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:36:18 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: script nodes - layers generated by a project .js
 file

A frame carrying telecode/script plugin data {file, inputs, seed, status} is
a script node. Its file's // @schema / @input header (number, string,
boolean, color, enum, ref; $Collection/name binds a variable) becomes
property controls; running it executes the program in a sandboxed iframe +
Web Worker (no DOM, no network, synchronous, 2 s, 1000 nodes, seeded
Math.random) and replaces the frame's children with the Design JSX it
returns. Re-runs on input, size and file changes (polled); errors are kept
on the node and posted to the host (td-editor:scripts). Tools:
telecode_script_create/_set/_run/_list/_convert.
